WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.022 --> 00:00:02.637
- We're back, baby! Cosplay, part two!

00:00:02.637 --> 00:00:04.773
- So, we watched a bunch
of anime and decided

00:00:04.773 --> 00:00:06.605
that we're going to go with
Sailor Moon characters.

00:00:06.605 --> 00:00:08.590
- Pretty Guardians already
sounds like a great band name,

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:10.071
so we're just going to
take that literally.

00:00:10.071 --> 00:00:11.557
- Because it's like
all these strong women.

00:00:11.557 --> 00:00:12.888
We can be strong women.

00:00:12.888 --> 00:00:14.685
- We decided to make our
concept really unique

00:00:14.685 --> 00:00:17.305
by turning the Sailor Scouts into men.

00:00:17.305 --> 00:00:19.972
- Not try and make fun of it, but to have

00:00:19.972 --> 00:00:22.386
an honest portrayal of
how bad-ass they are.

00:00:22.386 --> 00:00:24.771
- Cosplay is all about
passion and creativity,

00:00:24.771 --> 00:00:26.201
so we're taking a lot of our passions

00:00:26.201 --> 00:00:28.002
and creatively mixing them together.

00:00:28.002 --> 00:00:28.502
- Punk rock.

00:00:28.502 --> 00:00:29.056
- 80's glam.

00:00:29.056 --> 00:00:29.690
- Ned's wife.

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:31.738
- Meets dudes Cosplay.

00:00:31.738 --> 00:00:34.059
Have you seen a lot of post-apocalyptic,

00:00:34.059 --> 00:00:37.986
80's glam, punk rock band
Sailor Scouts before?

00:00:37.986 --> 00:00:39.545
- No.

00:00:39.545 --> 00:00:41.679
I'm Olivia, and I am a cosplayer.

00:00:41.679 --> 00:00:42.993
- When we were watching Sailor Moon,

00:00:42.993 --> 00:00:45.744
we realized we kind of fit
the character archetypes.

00:00:45.744 --> 00:00:46.829
- Zach is a tiny nerd.

00:00:46.829 --> 00:00:47.862
- Sailor Mercury.

00:00:47.862 --> 00:00:49.112
- Keith is a big ol' man, who loves

00:00:49.112 --> 00:00:50.413
shoving food in his big ol' mouth.

00:00:50.413 --> 00:00:51.860
- The Sailor, Jupiter.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:52.879
- Ned loves love.

00:00:52.879 --> 00:00:54.143
- Love, love, love, love, love.

00:00:54.143 --> 00:00:54.963
- Sailor Venus.

00:00:54.963 --> 00:00:57.026
- Eugene's Sailor Mars,
because he's sassy.

00:00:57.026 --> 00:00:57.825
- She's kind of a bitch.

00:00:57.825 --> 00:00:59.244
- I feel like I'm her already.

00:00:59.244 --> 00:01:01.215
We just did not like Sailor Moon.

00:01:01.215 --> 00:01:02.775
She's very annoying in the first season.

00:01:02.775 --> 00:01:03.279
(buzzer)

00:01:03.279 --> 00:01:04.660
- If we show up with half-assed costumes,

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:06.407
people are going to
judge the f*** out of us.

00:01:06.407 --> 00:01:09.310
- I thought cosplay was
all bought costumes.

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:10.794
- No, they make that s***.

00:01:10.794 --> 00:01:12.442
- I'm gonna get frustrated. Whoops.

00:01:12.442 --> 00:01:14.278
- I'm ready to do whatever
it takes to make the

00:01:14.278 --> 00:01:17.562
best costumes in the history
of me ever making a costume.

00:01:17.562 --> 00:01:18.727
- We're gonna need some help.

00:01:18.727 --> 00:01:21.827
- [Voicover] The Try Guys
Try Cosplay, Episode Two,

00:01:21.827 --> 00:01:24.944
the Try Guys Make Sailor Moon Costumes.

00:01:24.944 --> 00:01:27.147
- My name's Linda Le,
and I am a Cosplayer.

00:01:27.147 --> 00:01:29.042
Something like this
took me about 700 hours.

00:01:29.042 --> 00:01:29.979
- What?!

00:01:29.979 --> 00:01:31.478
- 700?!

00:01:31.478 --> 00:01:32.626
