know what worbla is,

00:02:31.458 --> 00:02:34.075
it's thermal plastic. With
heat, what happens to it,

00:02:34.075 --> 00:02:36.867
it gets really soft. Almost like pasta.

00:02:36.867 --> 00:02:38.135
- Tiara-ravioli.

00:02:38.135 --> 00:02:40.445
